WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:10.733
Question five, another number series!

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.933
One hundred, ninety-two,

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:16.400
eighty-four, seventy-six, and then...

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.733
what? A, seventy...

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.167
B, sixty-eight... C,

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:23.367
sixty-six... or D,

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:26.133
seventy-two? Five seconds!

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.200
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.867
The answer is...

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:38.867
B, sixty-eight! Every step drops

00:00:38.867 --> 00:00:41.200
by eight, and seventy-six minus

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.067
eight is sixty-eight!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.033
So, are you smart or fart?

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.800
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.433
find your rank!

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:52.867
So, how did you do?

00:00:52.867 --> 00:00:54.300
Comment your score below,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.967
and follow for more!
